{"articleNo":"66259","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=66259&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012학년도 2학기 성적취소 및 이수구분 변경신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.09.24","hit":"9339","attachments":[{"name":"성적취소 및 이수구분 변경 안내(게시판).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=66259&attachNo=2971"},{"name":"폐지과목내역.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=66259&attachNo=3081"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">2012학년도 2학기 성적취소 및 이수구분 변경신청</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #7c43b1\"><font color=\"#ffffff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">1. 성적취소 </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br></font></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"> 가. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">신청기간 : 2012.09.28.(금)~2012.10.05.(금)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp; 나. 신청장소 : 해당 종합학사행정실&nbsp;</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null\">&nbsp; 다. 제출서류 : 성적취소 신청원 1부(성적증명서 제출 생략)</span></span><br></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#3d0099\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 정확한 성적취소 처리를 위해 신청원 작성시 </span></span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#3d0099\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 교과목코드, 교과목명을 정확히 기재하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">라. 신청방법 : 성적취소 신청원 작성→해당 종합학사행정실 제출</span></strong></span><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp; 마. 성적취소내역 확인</span><br></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) 일시 : 2012.10.12.(금) [</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">예정]</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 확인방법 : 원스톱서비스-학적부-학적자료조회-성적정정/포기</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">바. 성적취소 대상자 및 범위 </span><br></strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">1) 교육과정의 개정으로 폐지된 교과목의 </u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">성적</span></u></span><u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><br></u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <u style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">2) 7학기이상 등록자에 한하여 6학점 이내(재학 중 1회에 한함)의 성적</u></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#3d0099\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#3d0099\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#5d5d5d\">※</font> </span></font></span></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">규정변경 사항</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ 당초 :&nbsp; 7학기이상 이수하고 8학기이상 등록한 자에 한하여 6학점이내의 성적(1회에 한함)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ 변경 : 7학기이상 등록자에 한하여 6학점이내(재학중 1회에 한함)의 성적</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; → 기존 8학기 상에서 7학기 이상 등록자 중 </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 7학기 또는 8학기 중 취소 학기를&nbsp; 학생이 선택하도록 함</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; → 단, 2009학년도 이전 입학자는 2010학년도 이후 최초 2개 재학학기에 한하여 </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 학기당 6학점(6학점×2학기=12학점)성적취소 가능<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 예시1) 2010학년도 11학기·2학기 재학은 했으나, 성적취소를 안했더라도 기회는 없음<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 예시2) 2010학년도 1학기·2학기 및 2011학년도 1학기·2학기 휴학하고, </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2012학년도 1학기·2학기 재학할 경우, </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2012학년도 1학기·2학기기 각각 성적취소 신청 가능<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 졸업예정자로서 그 성적이 “F”인 과목<br></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><div style=\"BACKGROUND: url(http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/webeditor/images/deco/line06.gif?rv=1.0.1) repeat-x left 50%; WIDTH: 99%; HEIGHT: 15px\"><hr style=\"BORDER-TOP-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-LEFT-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: black; LEFT: -999px; BORDER-BOTTOM-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: black; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: black; POSITION: relative; TOP: -999px; BORDER-RIGHT-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: black\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #7c43b1\"><font color=\"#ffffff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">2. 이수구분변경&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span><br></font></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 가. 신청기간 :&nbsp; 2012.09.28.(금)~2012.10.05.(금)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp; 나. 신청장소 : 해당 종합학사행정실</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp; 다. 제출서류 : 이수구분변경 신청원 1부</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">&nbsp; </span>라. 신청방법 : 이수구분변경 신청원 작성→해당 종합학사행정실 제출</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">마. 성적취소내역 확인</span></strong><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) 일시 : 2012.10.12.(금) [예정]</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;2) 확인방법 : 원스톱서비스-학적부-학적자료조회-성적[성적표 출력]</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>&nbsp; 바. 이수구분 변경 대상</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) 전부 및 전과로 인한 이수구분변경</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ 전부 이전의 전공과목이 전선으로 되어 있는 경우→일선으로 변경</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ 주·야 전부의 경우 전필과목이 전선으로 되어 있는 경우→전필로 변경</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 동일 학부내의 전공과목을 이수하였으나 일선으로 되어 있는 과목→ 전선으로 변경</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 기필과목을 이수 했으나 기선으로 되어있는 과목→기필로 변경</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4) 교직과정 이수 포기 신청을 한 학생 중 직필로 되어 있는 과목</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; →일선, 전선, 전필로 변경</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 5) 교육과정의 변경으로 이수구분 변경가능 한 과목 등</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ 이수했을 당시 전선이었으나 현재 교육과정에 기필로 되어 있는 과목</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ 이수했을 당시 교선이었으나 현재 교육과정에 교필로 되어 있는 과목 등</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">2012.&nbsp; 09.&nbsp; 24.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">교&nbsp; 무&nbsp; 처&nbsp; 장</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
